# Oxc Quality Gate

Before marking any file-changing task complete:

1. Run `bun run format` to apply Oxfmt.
2. Run `bun run quality` (`format:check` + `lint`) and fix all findings.
3. If checks fail, fix the issues or report the blocker. Do not claim the task is done.

Use `bun run lint:fix` only when auto-fixes are safe. Do not weaken lint rules to silence failures.
